            "Additionally, if you cast this while under the effect of see invisibility, true seeing, or any other spell that allows you to see invisible creatures, you can activate a faerie fire effect (as the spell) on any invisible creature or object within 60 feet as a swift action. Doing this ends the duration of vision of the omniscient eye; the faerie fire effect lasts for 1 minute.<br>",
