            "You create a zone of disruptive arcane harmonies that interfere with spells that have verbal components. Casters within the area find their spells' spoken words warped, twisted, and blurred, disrupting their efforts. Any creature (other than you) that attempts to cast a spell with a verbal component in this area must succeed on a Concentration check (DC 20 + the spell's level).<br>",
