            "Two additional monstrous heads sprout from your shoulders, and two batlike wings stretch out to the sky. You take the form of a chimera (MM 34); choose the color of your dragon head from the options noted in the monster description when you cast the spell. You gain 30 temporary hit points, which disappear at the end of the spell s duration. See the Polymorph Subschool sidebar on page 91 for more details.<br>"
