            "This spell summons a hound archon from the Seven Mounting Heavens of Celestia. It appears where you designate and acts immediately, on your turn. It understands your speech (regardless of your language), and it follows your commands to the best of its ability. You must concentrate on the spell's effect, but commanding the creature is a free action.<br>",
