            "A green ray stabs from your pointing finger. You must succeed on a ranged touch attack with the ray to affect a target. A subject that is successfully targeted must make a Fortitude save or be paralyzed for the duration of the spell. A subject of the ray that succeeds on its Fortitude save is instead sickened. A neutralize poison spell removes the effect from a sickened creature, and creatures immune to poison are unaffected by the stench.<br>",
