            "<br>",
            "Magical effects, including acid fog, cloudkill, and green dragon breath, are negated only if your level is greater than the offending spell s caster level (or the dragon s HD). If your level is lower than the caster level, the dance of the unicorn grants everyone within the mist a +4 bonus on their saving throws against the effect.<br>",
