        "Subschool": null,
        "Description": [
            "The warded creature or object becomes difficult to detect by divination spells such as clairaudience/clairvoyance, locate object, and detect spells. Nondetection also prevents location by such magic items as crystal balls. If a divination is attempted against the warded creature or item, the caster of the divination must succeed on a caster level check (1d20 + caster level) against a DC of 11 + the caster level of the spellcaster who cast nondetection. If you cast nondetection on yourself or on an item currently in your possession, the DC is 15 + your caster level.<br>",
            "<br>",
            "If cast on a creature, nondetection wards the creature's gear as well as the creature itself.<br>",
            "<br>",
            "Material Component: A pinch of diamond dust worth 50 gp.<br>"
        ],
        "Target": " Creature or object touched",
        "Level": {
            "Ranger": 4,
            "Wizard": 3,
            "Trickery": 3
        },
        "URL": "https://srd.dndtools.org/srd/magic/spells/spells/spellsAllCore.html#nondetection",
