            "You summon unholy power to gird yourself in a dragon- shaped cocoon of bones and negative energy. The cocoon gives you a +4 enhancement bonus to your natural armor and a +4 deflection bonus to Armor Class, plus 1 temporary hit point per caster level (maximum 20). You are treated as armed when you make unarmed attacks, and you deal damage as if your limbs were short swords of an appropriate size. You can use your off hand to attack, incurring the standard two-weapon fighting penalties (see page 160 of the Player s Handbook).<br>",
