            "You create a swarm of faintly luminous motes of pure force that engulf one creature, obscuring its vision. If the target relies on sight, all its attacks have a 20% miss chance while the motes last. The motes also deal 1d6 points of damage each round. The target can attempt a Reflex save each round to avoid the damage.<br>",
