            "Your target loses the chosen supernatural ability until it undergoes a ritual of renaming or is the target of a wish or miracle spell. If the subject has a temporary supernatural ability (such as those granted to binders by vestiges), it loses that ability, but this spell does nothing to prevent the subject from gaining the same or other supernatural abilities later.<br>",
