            "Effect: One or more creatures, no two of which can be more than 30 ft. apart<br>",
            "This spell functions like summon nature's ally I, except that you can summon one 6th-level creature, 1d3 5th-level creatures of the same kind, or 1d4+1 lower-level creatures of the same kind.<br>",
