            "You gain a +2 sacred bonus on all saving throws and +2 dodge bonus to Armor Class. Once during the spell s duration, as an immediate action, you can choose to discharge the spell to gain a greater bonus. When you discharge the spell in this manner, you gain a sacred bonus on all saving throws and a dodge bonus to your Armor Class equal to 1/2 your caster level (maximum +25). This bonus lasts until the beginning of your next turn.<br>"
