            "While this spell is in effect and you are wielding a longbow, shortbow, greatbow*, composite greatbow*, composite shortbow, or composite longbow, you threaten all squares within your normal melee reach (5 feet if Small or Medium, 10 feet if Large) with your bow, allowing you to make attacks of opportunity with arrows shot from the bow.<br>",
