            "The winds carry her voice away, so she can speak but cannot be heard, and she cannot hear anything but the roar of the winds. Furthermore, no sonic or language-dependent spells or effects may be cast into or out of the binding winds (though spells cast by the caster upon himself function normally). Ranged attacks made into or out of the binding winds suffer a  2 penalty.<br>",
