            "</table><br><br>",
            "This enhancement bonus is defensive only; it does not cause a shield to function as a magic weapon if it is used to make a shield bash. The enhancement bonus of the armor or shield is +2 if your caster level is 9th'11th, +3 if it's 12th'14th level, +4 if it's 15th'16th, and +5 if it's 18th or higher.<br>"
