        "Desc": "In casting this spell, you see what others do not'strings of silver energy running from your hands and feet to your target's wrists and ankles. You wave, and she waves back, in an awkward, resisting fashion. You start walking toward the edge of the cliff. . . .",
        "Saving Throw": " Will negates",
