        "Effect": " A wall of whirling limbs up to 20ft-long / level, or a ring of whirling limbs with a radius of up to 5ft / 2 levels, either form 20ft-high",
        "Spell Resistance": " Yes",
        "Range": " Medium (100ft + 10ft / level)",
