        "Desc": "With a hot exhalation and a circular wave of your outstretched arm, a stifling wind tears across the landscape, kicking up clouds of dust and sand and spreading out to blow over your foes.",
        "Saving Throw": " Fortitude negates; see text",
        "Name": "Blood Sirocco"
